### GET /users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json

### GET /users/:id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### POST /users
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Aryan",
    "age": 21
}

### PATCH /users/:id
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ansh"
}

### DELETE /users/:id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json


